" >This isn\u2019t a playground. It\u2019s a system. Enemies adapt. Landmarks evolve. Events react. Consequences echo across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No branching cutscenes. Just action, and the weird burning world you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741160/extras/da10c09a5178ce93da5f3386ffcd5af4.avif?t=1751974832\" width=616 height=264 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Stylish, skill-based driving meets systemic roguelite mayhem. Drive, destroy, and survive in an alternate 1970s where AI healed the Earth by erasing humanity. Deep buildcraft. Physics with opinions. A reactive world that holds a grudge. Just you, your car, and the chaos you leave behind.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
